 "guidance": {
  "status": "ok",
  "transcriptsRead": 3,
  "statements": [
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Our aim remains to deliver a spread at a portfolio level in our guided range of 5% to 5.25%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "As we continue to invest for growth, we expect this ratio to remain broadly range-bound within 2.6% to 2.7%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-3",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 13,
    "speaker": "Jyoti Khatri",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Do you foresee, although your incremental cost of borrowing has come down and your guidance sustains 5% to 5.25% margins.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-4",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 14,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We are very confident of maintaining the spread above 5%, which is in our guidance range of 5% to 5.25%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-5",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 16,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "And even if you go back to that year, our guidance has always remained spread in 5% to 5.25% range.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-6",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 17,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "And that is what gives us the confidence that we should be able to do this 25% growth.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-7",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 20,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "So we have guided to a 25% growth, sir.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We expect this ratio to remain range bound within 2.6%-2.7% as we focus on growth and expansion.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 7,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "The target is to end the year at 25% AUM growth.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-3",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 7,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "And again, for the next year, we have given the guidance of 25% growth on AUM.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-4",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 11,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "But like I said, we want to stick to the AUM guidance of 25%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-5",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 11,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "And hence, the whole spread guidance of FY25, the whole AUM growth guidance as well, we want to stick to that and then let the rest of the interplaying forces be with the internal teams and then deliver on the guidance.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-6",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 12,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "The guidance we had given was Rs. 20,000 crores by March 2027.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-7",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 12,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "With 25% growth, next year, we will hit about Rs. 19,600-Rs. 19,700 crores.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-8",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 25,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Similarly, we are you can say guidance or our vision or projection for 2030 is Rs. 35,000 crores.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-01-9",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-01",
    "callLabel": "Jan 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-01",
    "page": 26,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "That will be in the region of around 20%-23% AUM growth Y-o-Y if we have to get to Rs. 35,000 crores.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We expect this ratio to remain range-bound within 2.6% to 2.7% as we focus on growth and expansion.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 9,
    "speaker": "Nutan Gaba Patwari",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "However, the spread, we should be able to maintain in the 5% to 5.25% that we have always guided.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-3",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 13,
    "speaker": "Shreepal Doshi",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "So, in that case, like for the full year we had guided for a Rs. 5,600 crores to Rs. 5,800 crore disbursement.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-4",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 13,
    "speaker": "Manoj Viswanathan",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "But broadly, we are guiding to that 25% plus AUM growth, so this quarter it was 26%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
